id: pm-ts-starter-codeql-dot-contract
title: Make the CodeQL tracker exclusion contract load-bearing
description: "Separate follow-up found while reviewing checkout credentials. In test/ci-tiers.test.ts, Node path.matchesGlob skips leading-dot components for **. Removing !.agents/pm/** from either push or pull_request patterns still leaves the synthetic tracker item excluded in the reducer. Require ordered include/exclude/re-include assertions or a GitHub-compatible matcher, with a mutation regression removing the tracker exclusion, while preserving executable inclusion assertions. The published workflow currently has the exclusion; this is a contract gap."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
tags[2]: ci,follow-up
